<title>Compliance</title><para>The XML output conforms to the BPMN 2.0 schema at <ulink url="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL">http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL</ulink> (ISO/IEC 19510:2013).</para>
</sect2></sect1>
<sect1 id="classthemis_1_1process_1_1_bpmn_serializer_1autotoc_md2_1s1"><sect2 id="classthemis_1_1process_1_1_bpmn_serializer_1autotoc_md2">
<title>Error Handling (Phase 3)</title><para>All import errors are explicit and actionable:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Empty input → EMPTY_INPUT</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Oversized input (&gt;10 MiB) → INPUT_TOO_LARGE</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Malformed XML → MALFORMED_INPUT</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Structural/semantic graph violations → SEMANTIC_VIOLATION</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>File I/O errors (importFile only) → FILE_READ_ERROR</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>No silent failures or missing error codes. </para>
</sect2></sect1>
